IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TXT PIC X(5) JUSTIFIED RIGHT VALUE "A".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
